      <activity id="ad2d0b37-e0c6-5357-9cf5-6c0520e4161d" activityNameId="f8f68144-9df5-589e-a416-9ec6a5d74d2e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, natural gas, onshore pipeline, long distance</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, natural gas, onshore pipeline, long distance
Infrastructure requirements are based on estimated standard capacity. UUID=1cc06dd1-cd86-37f3-b9fe-6602b4000be7
This dataset describes the energy consumption and the emissions linked to the transport of Uzbek natural gas in an onshore pipeline.
Location: The data for emissions are based on European data and for energy requirements on German data.
Technology: Long-distance transport onshore with  average compressor station.
Time period: The data for emissions is from 2006, the data for energy requirements from 2001
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1cc06dd1-cd86-37f3-b9fe-6602b4000be7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="48eb4801-7686-5c61-870b-da5b420b6de1" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
